      "text": "preach, exhort, declare, D&C 19:37. priesthood bearers’ duty to exhort, D&C 20:42, 46–47, 50, 59. teachers are to visit members, exhorting them to pray, D&C 20:51. Hyrum Smith’s calling is to exhortation, D&C 23:3. Emma Smith ordained to exhort Church as led by the Spirit, D&C 25:7. elders called to strengthen churches by exhortation, D&C 50:37. strengthen your brethren in all your exhortations, D&C 108:7. scattered remnants are exhorted to return to the Lord, D&C 113:10.",
